# Horizontal and Vertical on an empty sketch: two segments drawn slanted,
# which suggest nothing; Horizontal, tool first, levels the first (h1);
# Vertical on the selection of the second makes it plumb (v1) and quits;
# Horizontal on the second is then refused, and the status bar says why.
open tests/data/sketch-blank.json
wait 16
action tool.segment
wait 2
click L 415 503
click L 743 449
click L 469 394
click L 524 175
key Escape
key Escape
wait 2
action tool.horizontal
wait 2
click L 661 462
wait 2
key Escape
wait 2
select element L2
action tool.vertical
wait 2
action tool.horizontal
wait 2
click L 497 284
wait 4
